given-names></name><name><surname>Hartl</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Evidence for maternally transmitted small interfering RNA in the repression of transposition in <named-content content-type="genus-species">Drosophila virilis</named-content></article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci U S A</source><volume>102</volume><fpage>15965</fpage><lpage>15970</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16247000</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0050303-b030"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Grewal</surname><given-names>SI</given-names></name><name><surname>Elgin</surname><given-names>SC</given-names></name></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Transcription and RNA interference in the formation of heterochromatin</article-title><source>Nature</source><volume>447</volume><fpage>399</fpage><lpage>406</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17522672</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0050303-b031"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Zaratiegui</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Irvine</surname><given-names>DV</given-names></name><name><surname>Martienssen</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Noncoding RNAs and gene silencing</article-title><source>Cell</source><volume>128</volume><fpage>763</fpage><lpage>776</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17320512</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list><glossary><def-list><title>Abbreviations</title><def-item><term>rasiRNA</term><def><p>repeat-associated small interfering RNA</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>RNAi</term><def><p>RNA interference</p></def></def-item><def-item><term><italic>SD</italic></term><def><p>Segregation Distorter</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>TE</term><def><p>transposable element</p></def></def-item></def-list></glossary><fn-group><fn id="n1" fn-type="current-aff"><p>Patrick M. Ferree is a Postdoctoral Fellow and Dani